                                "sense_id": "8097cc85-c1da-326d-8df4-9c0b755d70b5",
                                "text": "The neoliberals stand today in somewhat the position neoconservatives occupied a decade ago. Their ambition is to attain the influence in liberal politics that the neoconservatives have attained in conservative politics."
